  "SCORER World is a separate ad-free application and can be played offline. Careers and imported names stay on this device; there is no SCORER account or in-app purchase verification service.": "SCORER World是独立的无广告应用，可离线游玩。生涯及导入的名称保存在本机，不使用SCORER账号或应用内购买验证服务。",
  "Careers and name edits are stored privately on this device. Uninstalling or clearing app data removes them; a new game keeps a private backup. There is no SCORER account or career upload.": "生涯和名称修改保存在本机私有空间。卸载应用或清除数据会删除这些内容；新游戏会保留私有备份。不提供SCORER账号，也不会上传生涯。",
  "Free and World are separate applications with independent private saves. This app has no in-app purchase or purchase-verification service. World store purchases, when offered, are handled by the store.": "Free和World是两个独立应用，各有私有存档。本应用不提供应用内购买或购买验证服务。World开售后，其购买流程由商店处理。",
