  "Choose New Game or Load Game. Name your player and select a first contract. World suggests your phone’s country, with England Division 4 as another option.": "选择新游戏或载入游戏，为球员命名并选择第一份合同。World会推荐手机设置的国家，也可选择从英格兰第四级别起步。",
  "Complete the three-shot weekly training to unlock Play. You can resume an unfinished session, but only one session is available each career week. Energy and morale affect your chances. Progress saves automatically.": "完成每周三次射门训练即可开始比赛。未完成的训练可以继续，但生涯每周只有一次训练。体力和士气会影响机会，进度自动保存。",
  "Tap the goal to aim and shoot. Watch the moving aim, power and shot timer. Opponent strength changes the number and difficulty of chances. Continue at half-time and full-time.": "轻触球门瞄准并射门，留意移动准星、力度和倒计时。对手实力会影响机会数量和难度。中场及全场结束时选择继续。",
  "World has no ads. Use the names editor to rename clubs, leagues and players or import a JSON names file. Changes stay on this device and do not alter statistics.": "World无广告。可用编辑器修改俱乐部、联赛及球员名称，或导入JSON名称文件。修改仅保存在本机，不会改变统计数据。",
